          "text": "Toss shrimp, bell pepper, pineapple, avocado, red onion, cilantro, lime juice, serrano, garlic, salt, and black pepper together in a glass or ceramic bowl until thoroughly combined. Cover the bowl with plastic wrap; refrigerate for 1 hour."
